B.bi0=s(["**In transit:** all communication between the app and backend uses TLS 1.2 or higher.","**At rest:** Firestore encrypts all data by default (AES-256).","**Passwords:** stored only as a hash by Firebase Authentication (scrypt). We have no access to plaintext passwords.","**Local PIN:** stored as SHA-256 hash with random salt in Keychain (iOS) / Keystore (Android). Never leaves the device.","**Biometrics:** Face ID / Touch ID are handled by the OS. Fintab never receives or stores biometric data.","**Firestore security rules:** each user can only read and write data tied to their own UID."],t.s)
